    "detailed_description": "Dreadful monsters were stirring in the cave where Udonge had fallen into.<br>Low-class monsters starving for females creep up, one after another.<br>Can she escape the violence of sexual desire, or will she be trapped and have everything destroyed by sheer pleasure and humiliation?<br>This is a derivative work, a fan work of Touhou Project.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action Game</strong></h2>Control Udonge to break through the caves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640560/extras/a870a066d272eea6b606770269c46bf6.avif?t=1700174220\" width=610 height=364 /></span><br>&quot;Udonge in Interspecies Cave&quot; is a simple action game. Move, jump, shoot! Use these actions to break through the dungeon teeming with monsters.<br>Defeat the three stages and their bosses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640560/extras/f4144d0ca300b46817eda76784164975.avif?t=1700174220\" width=756 height=524 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If your health reaches zero...</strong></h2>You'd better recover quickly, or something unbelievable will happen...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640560/extras/def20a8131af483e5ec3555f1b9c3155.avif?t=1700174220\" width=610 height=364 /></span><br>When your health reaches 0, Udonge becomes immobile. By pressing the move keys left or right, you can charge a gauge to get back up... but if you're caught by a monster during this time...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Something unbelievable...</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640560/extras/c04214ade306225cee409c6e7edd3f0a.avif?t=1700174220\" width=610 height=364 /></span><br>Unthinkable consequences! Various monsters each have their own dot motions on the map. You can still escape in this state, but if a certain event happens, it's game over...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Numerous game-over screens.</strong></h2>When you transition to the game-over screen, you can view large-size motions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640560/extras/28245cc6d145e60941ec803c07ca54a6.poster.avif?t=1700174220\" width=374 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640560/extras/28245cc6d145e60941ec803c07ca54a6.webm?t=1700174220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640560/extras/28245cc6d145e60941ec803c07ca54a6.mp4?t=1700174220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With each stage cleared, a gallery is unlocked, allowing you to view scenes at any time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640560/extras/cefc31aec6ad3baf70ddd1098d450f9c.avif?t=1700174220\" width=800 height=448 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640560/extras/b293611bf9697d1c2fd9ade1bd5121b0.avif?t=1700174220\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br>Will Udonge be able to safely escape this cave swarming with monsters...?",
